This project uses AGENTS.md as the single source of truth for all AI agent instructions.
Cursor reads AGENTS.md automatically — see the project root for complete guidelines.

## 📁 Project Structure Rules

**Documentation & Reports:**
- All new `.md` files must go in `docs/`
- All test reports, logs, and output files must go in `docs/`
- Keep documentation organized and centralized

**Source Code:**
- All new code files (`.ts`, `.tsx`, `.js`, `.jsx`) must go in `src/`
- Maintain the existing module structure in `src/`
- Follow the current directory organization patterns

**Key Directories:**
- `src/app/` — Next.js app routes and pages
- `src/components/` — React components
- `src/lib/` — Utility functions and helpers
- `src/modules/` — Feature modules
- `src/types/` — TypeScript type definitions
- `docs/` — All documentation and reports
